window.products.push({"id":794025,"name":"Berry Ave 9-Tier Tree Bookshelf - Unique Bookshelf for Books, Magazines, DVDs & More- Space Saving Spine Book Tower - Free Standing Bookcase in Modern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JCQAHot0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE BEAUTIFUL HOME YOUR BOOKS DESERVE: Store all your books, DVDs, movies, video games, magazines or work files, in the most beautiful and eye-catching 9-tier tree shaped bookcase by Berry Ave. Modern and space-saving, this spine bookshelf makes a great sophisticated addition to any room that needs a stylish and practical update, without occupying much of your floor space. (Dimensions: 49.8x8.66x15.75 inches) HEAD TURNING DESIGN TO MAKE ANY ROOM STAND OUT: Thanks to its unique shape, this 9-tier tree bookshelf can reinvent the style of any room, adding a modern, cozy flair everyone would love. Perfect for the living room, dining room, kitchen, hallway, bedroom, nursery and even your office. Available in 3 timeless colors (black, brown, white), you can definitely find the one that best fits your needs. A MUST HAVE SPACE SAVING BOOKSHELF FOR ANY BOOK LOVER: With 9 spacious shelves, this free-standing bookcase allows easy access to all your favorite books. You can even organize them based on genre, author, color or whatever pleases you the most. As this geometric bookcase can hold dozens of books at once, you can officially forget all about messy book stacks and clutter! VIDEO INSTRUCTIONS FOR HASSLE FREE ASSEMBLY: Coming to you with a step-by-step installation video and well written instructions, along with all the necessary hardware, you may rest assured that your floor book shelf will be ready in just a few minutes. Made of the highest quality Particle Board with Melamine Veneer, the durability and sturdiness of this tower bookcase won’t let you down!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JCQAHot0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Berry Ave","source_asin":"B084Q6R6MX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084Q6R6MX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084Q6R6MX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
