window.products.push({"id":794050,"name":"Meat Grinder Electric AAOBOSI Heavy Duty Meat Mincer【2200W Max】ETL Approved 3-IN-1 Sausage Stuffer and Grinder with 3 Size Plates, Sausage Tube & Kubb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ln+NUjIXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥞【PREMIUM ATTACHMENTS & ETL Approved】Meat grinder electric all have the owned ETL safety certifications. Work as a Meat Mincer, Sausage Stuffer Maker, and Kubbe Maker. And the food grinders electric attachment provides almost every function you need. Easily mince meat, make meatballs and meat sauce, prepare Italian sausage, summer sausage etc. To create the most delicious snacks at home or party in a healthier way. 🍣【3-STAGE SPIRAL ROD TECHNOLOGY & EASY CLEANING】The electric meat grinder is easy to use by pressing the buttons. While starting, the auger grinds the meat in 3 steps of spiral extrusion without destroying the meat fiber. It ensures the chewy and firm sense of the ground meat. After finishing, you could easily install and remove the parts. Clean them thoroughly in warm water. The parts are Dishwasher Unavailable and always dry immediately for longer service life. 🥣【SAFETY & EXCEPTIONAL DESIGN】Meat grinder all accessories made of food-grade materials, both housing and blade are made of premium stainless steel. The aobosi meat grinder machine is equipped with \"Dual Safety Switch\". Only start the machine when two switches are all in the \"on\" state. Avoid turning it on accidentally. If something remained stuck, the reverse button is fixed immediately. A Safety Circuit Breaker prevents the small meat grinder from high temperatures. 🥣【HEALTHY AND NUTRITIOUS】With this meat grinder heavy duty, DIY your family food and control the meat-fat ratio. The auger slowly grinds the meat in 3 steps of spiral extrusion, which keeps the meat cool and locks in the texture and flavor of the meat. Prepare tenacious meat or pasta with ease. Aobosi food processor is a good helper in Kitchen. Economical, save space and time. 🥣【CLEANING AND WARRANTY】 Clean all parts thoroughly in warm water. They are NOT dishwasher safe. Always dry the parts immediately after washing for longer service life. The electric meat grinders for home use only. We provide reliable customer service: 30-day money-back guarantee, 12-month replacement warranty, and lifetime service support!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ln+NUjIXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AAOBOSI","source_asin":"B0C7QYDZLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7QYDZLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7QYDZLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
