window.products.push({"id":794081,"name":"Comfort Zone PowrCurve CZHV101BK 9\" 3-Speed Wall-Mountable Floor Fan with 180-Degree Adjustable Tilt, 6-Blades, (Bracket Included), Black/Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816MnMIiPeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need to find the perfect fan for your living space? Lounging in a space that’s poorly ventilated is absolutely terrible. You get all irritable and sweaty, so there’s no way for you to feel truly relaxed or entertained. That’s why you’re on the lookout for a cooling fan that can effectively circulate the air inside your room. Aside from being powerful and durable, the fan has to be quiet and stylish! Experience total relaxation and comfort with the Comfort Zone PowerCurve 9” Turbo Fan. Feel cool as you watch television or read your favorite books with our turbo fan. Take advantage of its 180-degree tilt adjustment feature to perfectly point it to where you’re seated or lying down. Boasting a contemporary design, it also makes a stylish addition to any space. Equipped with a 100% all-copper, high-efficiency motor, this household cooling accessory will help foster a relaxing and soothing atmosphere in your home. With a wattage of 45W, this turbo fan will keep you cool without increasing your utility bills. Another thing to love about this reliable electric fan is it’s fitted with a 5ft cord which lets you plug and move it with ease. For your peace of mind, it’s also polarized with a safety fuse. Need more reasons to get this household cooling accessory? Check out these benefits: ✅ Comes in 2 eye-catching colors ✅ Can compliment any interior ✅ Fitted with 7.25” blades that are sturdy and durable ✅ Showcases a modern minimalist design Beat the summer heat without breaking the bank. Add the Comfort Zone 9” Turbo Fan to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816MnMIiPeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfort Zone","source_asin":"B0C5Z4VW76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5Z4VW76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5Z4VW76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
