window.products.push({"id":794267,"name":"Personalized Corner Atlanta Colors Themed Fleece Throw Blanket for Kids - Boys Girls Baby Toddler Infants Baseball Sports Theme Blankets for Bed (50\" ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ysl6cTv4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED – Create a truly unique and one-of-a-kind fleece throw blanket for yourself or someone you love.  Use the customizing tool to enter your name, their name, a funny saying, or an inside joke.  Whatever you choose, we will take your desired text and create an exclusive product just for you that will ship in three business days or less.  You’ll be snuggled up in no time! SO SNUGGLY – No matter the design or size, these blankets are sure to keep you and your loved ones warm on the coldest days and nights.  Perfect for an afternoon on the couch watching a game or movie, taking on a road trip for a quick snooze in the backseat, or keeping warm at the tailgate party.  This blanket goes where you go, and keeps you warm and cozy while you’re there. SIZE OPTIONS – With our three different size blankets to choose from, there is something for everyone.  The smallest blanket is 30”x40” and is perfect for small children and almost all pets (sorry horses).  The 50”x60” blanket is great for young kids who want to show their unique personality with a bit of personalized fun.  The 60”x80” blanket is just huge, excellent for any adults or children who love to ensconce themselves in fleece on their way to Sleepy Town, USA. WASHABLE – Nothing lasts forever, including a clean blanket.  One day you’re going to have to wash it, and that’s ok!  All blanket sizes are made from 100% washable fleece, and the best part is the custom image will never fade.  Because we use premium dye-sublimation materials in the production process, you can be sure that not only will the material last a lifetime, but the custom print will as well.  After you wash it, you can also put it in the dryer worry free.  Soft and warm, but durable, exactly how a top quality blanket should be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ysl6cTv4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Corner","source_asin":"B07JPR1NV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JPR1NV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JPR1NV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":794268,"name":"Maison d' Hermine Placemats 100% Cotton Premium Set of 4 Dinner Placemat, Decorative Washable Easter Cloth Placemat for Dining, Buffet Parties & Campi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QvtJ6P7pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT & DURABLE: Premium Collections from Maison d’ Hermine are an exclusive range of sophisticated designs & the products that are crafted from 100% COMBED COTTON. Comparing with regular cotton, combed cotton is superior since the fibres undergo an extra step before they are made into yarn, resulting in a softer, stronger & more luxurious fabric. PACKAGE INCLUDES: Set of 4 Placemats measures 13\"x19\". Comes with a premium gift box packaging. Each product in the Maison d’ Hermine Premium Collection is a perfect gift for all occasions & all seasons especially Thanksgiving, Christmas, Spring, Summer, Easter, Wedding, Party & So on. UNIQUE DESIGNS: All the products are exclusively designed in Europe & rendered in watercolor, with traditional motifs captured with a painter’s eye for light, hue, and lovely detail. A wide range of captivating designs to pick from, each designs in the Maison d’ Hermine Premium Collection are uniquely hand drawn by skilful artists. The attractive motifs punctuated with vibrant colors offer a real glimpse into the beauty of European designs. QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP: Tailored with care, our premium products are ideal for both formal and casual settings. We follow a variety of seaming and sewing techniques to make sure that the seams stay tacked and the corners are crisp and well mitered. The extra attention we pay to the sewing process results in corners that are caught securely with no loosely hanging threads, making our products a great choice for all occasions. EASY CARE & MAINTENANCE: Machine wash warm with like colors, do not bleach, tumble dry low and warm iron if needed. More coordinated Kitchen Linen and Table Linen products are available in our Premium Collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QvtJ6P7pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maison d' Hermine","source_asin":"B0BH8YJBZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH8YJBZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH8YJBZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":794269,"name":"12 Blue Plastic Oval Food/Burger Baskets plus 120 Checkered Deli Paper Liners. Restaurant/Food Tray Basket Sets for Barbecues, Picnics, Parties, Kids ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T44ahfdmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The warm weather is here and that means combining some of our favorite things - family, friends, and food! Our colorful plastic food baskets and checkered deli liners scream summertime and will pump up the fun factor of your next picnic, barbecue, party, or get together. The easy cleanup makes them ideal for that quick last minute family dinner. Try one of each color for your upcoming block party or 4th of July shindig! We threw in plenty of the deli liners so you can wrap your favorite fun foods all summer long. They’re grease resistant so wrap up those burgers, dogs, breakfast sandwiches, subs, tacos, brats, churros, pretzels and enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T44ahfdmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DESERT MERCANTILE","source_asin":"B07PQZ7RBV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PQZ7RBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PQZ7RBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
