window.products.push({"id":794407,"name":"Polish Pottery Small 9.5\" Oval Baker #1437","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XCoD7nHpL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This top quality piece of Polish Pottery Stoneware is designed for everyday use in your home. It is crack, chip, and scratch resistant. This premium cookware distributes heat evenly and retains both hot and cold temperatures for an extended period of time. The glaze allows foods to release with little or no oil, and clean up is quick and easy. Care should be taken to allow the piece to reach room temperature when going from the extreme of the refrigerator/freezer to the oven, as extreme temperature change will crack the pottery. When cooking high fat foods, it is suggested that you place a small amount of water in the bottom of the dish as this also protects your investment. Your 100% Satisfaction is our Guarantee!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XCoD7nHpL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ceramika Artystyczna","source_asin":"B00GVFPYI6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GVFPYI6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GVFPYI6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":794408,"name":"AUJOY Wingback Chair Cover Slipcover Stretch 2-Piece Couch Covers Jacquard Spandex Fabric Wing Back Armchair Sofa Protector with Anti-Slip Foams and S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QErEgLqtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To the modern decor, the home is never finished: It's always a work in progress. We are constantly changing the way it looks, rearranging the furniture, bringing in new pieces, changing the colors of our chairs. Solid coloring makes AUJOY slipcovers easily blend with our current color palette. Top quality materials with soft, breathable and skin-friendly features make it deeply favored by the world. ☑ Pet Friendly Protection People with pets are well aware of the struggle to win the never-ending battle against fur buildup. And if you’re not careful, your chair can quickly become a nest of unwanted fluff. This slipcover is a best pick for pet owners not only because it does a great job of protecting your wingback chair, but because it anchors foam rods to the seat to prevent slips caused by leaping cats and pups (or kids, for that matter). ☑Dust-proof Protection Our slipcover is totally dust-proof, we have taken use of the full-coverage cover for you, it will be a perfect protection from dirt, spills, food debris, footprints and Kids doodle. Great for those who are seeking the shields for furniture.Or if your wing chair is too old, don’t need to buy a new one. Just take our cover, it can freshen your chair up and give you a different visual effect. ☑High Stretch Differs from those cheap and common fabrics of others, this chair cover is crafted from spandex blend fabric, which makes it applicable to most wing chairs. And the elastic bottom hem wraps your sofa tightly to fit perfectly. Not easily deformed and more durable. If you have any confuses about how to install it after receiving or how to solve something during usage, you can contact with me directly, I will be happy to serve at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QErEgLqtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUJOY","source_asin":"B07XRR93J9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XRR93J9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XRR93J9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
