window.products.push({"id":794462,"name":"Portable Air Conditioners, Persona Mini Air Conditioner Fan, Small Portable Air Conditioner for Small Room, Car Air Conditioner for Bedroom, Office, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vWdY7A4KS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-Function Mini Air Conditioner --- Mini air conditioner fan, humidifier，air cooler fan, aroma diffuser, night light, five-in-one combination, multi-function design, let you stay away from the hot summer and enjoy a refreshing summer. You can use it as an ordinary small fan, add water, or ice to make cooler cold wind. The mist emitted not only increases the humidity of the air but also keeps the skin hydrated. Aromatherapy & night light function --- You can choose to add a little perfume in water or ice cubes, the mist and fragrance will make you feel more refreshing. The warm LED night light will emit a warm white shimmer, you can adjust it according to your sleep state, turn on/off the lighting button at any time. Method of Operation --- Click the knob button to turn on the LED night light, double click the button to turn off. Long press the knob to turn on the spray function, and long-press the knob to turn off (this function can only be turned on when the fan is working). Click the knob button to turn on the first speed of the fan, and then turn the knob to adjust the speed of the fan. Turn the knob clockwise to adjust the wind speed of the air-conditioning fan from low to high. Convenient to Carry --- portable air conditioner with wireless design is small in size, does not occupy space, you can easily move it to the bedroom, kitchen, living room, balcony, and other places to carry it with you. The small air conditioner water circulation fan with a built-in 2000mAh rechargeable battery can work continuously for 3-6 hours after being fully charged. (Can be charged by laptop/adapter/mobile power) More Comfortable --- Say goodbye to the trouble that the fan easily blows away the paper on the table, mini air conditioner brings a more comfortable and cooler summer feeling, especially suitable for office use and the elderly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vWdY7A4KS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jeteventy","source_asin":"B08YMWKWKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YMWKWKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YMWKWKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
