window.products.push({"id":794493,"name":"Zesthouse Mid-Century Modern Dining Chairs with Gold Metal Base, Accent Armless Kitchen Chairs with Channel Tufting, Upholstered Boucle Fabric Side Ch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OOTLRX0RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♞MODERN DESIGN: Mid-Century modern style fits very well into contemporary interiors. The aesthetics presents minimalist committed to weeding out the superfluousness and spends more time on what’s essential. The eternal desire is sticking to clean-cut and architectural lines as signature. Fusing expressionist with industrial manufacture, this chrome cantilever dining chair will be considerably perfect to finish off that spectacular look. ♘FRAME STRUCTURE: This cantilever seat marks the logical conclusion of the tube-steel chair, and is widely acknowledged as a masterpiece of design. Thanks to the curved tubular steel, the whole frame has implemented a cleaner and more rational geometric aesthetics. Because of the rigidity of steel, this incredibly durable frame grants a sturdy structure, ensuring a long-term service. Simultaneously chairs can be stacked together for ease of storage. ♔COMFORT: High-quality boucle fabric covering in padded seat and backrest is cozy enough to interface with your body. The deluxe cushion filled in high-density foam has the advantages of permeability and comfort. Upholstered back is also full of elasticity with strong resilience. Metal legs equipped with an anti-scratches and anti-noise pads protect your floor on the one hand and slip resistant rubber feet also ensure your balance on the other hand. ♕MULTIPURPOSE: Khaki dining chairs with lasting charms are one of the best furniture to transform style of interior. It will enhance the aesthetics wherever be used in dining room, kitchen room, living room as well as banquets. ♝ASSEMBLY: Easy to assemble. You can free up more time to spend with family and play with friends. If you have any problems or questions, please feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OOTLRX0RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zesthouse","source_asin":"B09B3K7XCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B3K7XCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B3K7XCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":794494,"name":"Homesick Scented Candle, Wisconsin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614ZM+84P-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description There’s a feeling that exists within every state, small town or city – an energy all its own. The smell of the air, the sounds of the morning and the memories that reside there can fill us with nostalgia when we return or rifle through mementos. These places exist in our memories, and though life often relocates us, the sentiment for our experience there remains. From the Manufacturer Bring home to you, no matter where you are Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. States, Cities, Countries and Memories Whether it’s the seabreezes of Southern California, the distinctive scents of spring days in Central Park in NYC or the vibrance of the energy that pulses through Brasil we have you covered. Books Scent: The main theme is an older leather bound book accord mixed with a woody desk character of cedar and sandalwood. Hints of balsamic and vanilla finish the complex scent. Grandmas Kitchen Table Scent: The scents of rich butter mixed with touches of apple, cinnamon, clove and a hint of sugar cookie. Tonka bean and sugar finish out this homey aroma. Summer Camp Scent: Fresh green grass accord with hints of crystal clear lake water, blooming hyacinth found along trails and just a touch of fresh lemon and smoke. Take Me Home Scent is the strongest tie to memory. Inhaling those sweet aromas while your mind immediately travesl back to those carefree days or amazing experienes. Home can mean so many things and it can be in so many places. Homesick Candles allows you bring bring all of those memories with you, no matter where you go! From your childhood state, to the city where you got engaged, to the best vacation ever in Hawaii to that epic Road Trip with your friends. We have a custom scent for all US States, iconic cities, vibrant countries and those memorable experiences. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Nostalgic, Memories, All-Natural How did you come up with the idea for this product? We were living in NYC and yet all of us were from somewhere else and missing home. In the winter of 2016, we sought out to find a way to keep that place with you, no matter where you live. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. keep that place with you, no matter where you live. What makes your product special? We finely craft custom scents that are tied to places and memories. Nostalgia in the warmth of a candle. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Collaborating with other small businesses and local input. We feel like we've taken a road trip thru the entire USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614ZM+84P-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homesick","source_asin":"B06XGLZZ6L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XGLZZ6L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XGLZZ6L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":794495,"name":"CleverMade SnapBasket 30 Liter Reusable Tote Bag with Reinforced Bottom: Collapsible Grocery Shopping Basket, Dark Teal/Fuchsia, 3 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915QjmF-KlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The CleverMade SnapBasket Collapsible Shopping Tote is a smart, space-saving solution to simplify all of your shopping trips and day-to-day tasks. It's designed with rip-stop fabric for extreme durability and water resistance. This versatile tote snaps open with ease, and features a zippered stash pocket for valuables. The flop-free structured design means no more spilled groceries. The CleverMade SnapBasket combines packing, transport and storage into one reusable, collapsible tote. This all-purpose tote can also increase the ease and efficiency of daily tasks and storage. Measuring 18.5\" L x 11.75\" W x 11.5\" H, it holds 30 liters (8 gallons) by volume, with a maximum load capacity of 25 pounds. Stability feet prevent tipping and 2 carry handles allow for steady and balanced transportation. This sturdy tote not only wipes clean, but collapses flat to 1.3\" for compact storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915QjmF-KlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CleverMade","source_asin":"B01MCSS698","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MCSS698","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MCSS698","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
