window.products.push({"id":794644,"name":"PacknWood Tulip White Silicone-Coated Paper Baking Cup,white tulip muffin liners,cupcake papers tulip (4 oz Capacity, 1.9” Diameter x 3.7” High) - Cas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LuV5dhj0L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made of parchment paper, our Tulips baking cups are as functional as they are attractive; an elegant presentation for all your baked goods. These baking cups fit in a standard muffin tin and hold 4 ounces (1/4 cup) each. The baking cup is safe for use in a microwave or an oven and is biodegradable. When assembled, the cup's four pointed tips resemble the petals of a tulip. The assembled cup has a 1.9-inch/50mm diameter, and measures 3.7-inch/95mm from the base to the tip. PacknWood is a well-established French manufacturer that specializes in the design and manufacture of elegant disposable food packaging. PacknWood offers the largest selection of plates, skewers, mini dishes, bake ware, serving-ware which are made from the most unique and natural materials: Bamboo, Wood, Palm Leaf, Sugarcane and Cornstarch all with a French touch to the design and presentation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LuV5dhj0L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PacknWood","source_asin":"B07DF1Z8K3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DF1Z8K3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DF1Z8K3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":794645,"name":"T-fal Patisserie 9-Inch Aluminum Total Nonstick Round Cake Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41U6QnzhzrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crowd-pleasing birthday cakes and perfectly even tiers are attainable with T-Fal’s nonstick round cake pan. Characteristic of this bakeware line, the excellent conductivity of 2.4-millimeter heavy-gauge aluminum distributes heat evenly and ensures uniform baking results. The pan rim, measuring just over two inches in height, gives plenty of room for cakes to climb. Both interior and exterior surfaces feature a three-layered nonstick coating to prevent baked-on batter from adhering--even exterior side drips come off with little effort. Measuring 9.75 by 9.75 by 2.25 inches with an interior diameter of 9 inches, this pan targets tiered cakes but can also be used for savory fare such as gratins or casseroles. Registering the authenticity of its craftsmanship, the patisserie logo can be found stamped on pan bottom. Manufactured in France and endorsed by Le Cordon Bleu, this product can be found in kitchens all over the globe. Dishwasher-safe and includes T-Fal’s lifetime limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41U6QnzhzrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-fal","source_asin":"B0000643YX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000643YX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000643YX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":794646,"name":"Zgioo Wok Pan with lid, Carbon Steel Wok 12.5\", Chinese Wok Flat Bottom Wok with 2 Spatulas & 1 Scrub Sponge Suits for All Stoves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714HDxa33FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Wok Set】The set comes with 5 items.You not only have quality 12.5\" wok pan with lid, but also get 2 Spatulas &1 Scrub Sponge. 【Perfect size】 The size of nonstick wok: 12.5 inches wide and 3.75 inches deep, the wok can supply food portions for at least 3-5 people, perfect for the whole family or kids parties. 【Carbon Steel Construction】The wok pan is made of high quality carbon steel, which is better than the ordinary woks on the market. This carbon steel wok heats up evenly and helps you stir-fry more delicious dishes. 【Multifunctional Wok】With its extremely fast heating speed, this chinese wok can be used for a variety of cooking methods. Such as frying, deep-frying, boiling, steaming, etc. In addition, the carbon steel wok can be used on induction, electric, gas stoves and other stoves. 【WARM TIPS】 The flat bottom wok needs to be cleaned and kept dry in time to avoid rusting, and a layer of cooking oil is applied to form an oil film after cleaning, so that the stir-fry will not be so sticky. If you have any questions or suggestions about the wok, please feel free to contact us and we will be happy to help you solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714HDxa33FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zgioo","source_asin":"B099YZ9Q7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099YZ9Q7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099YZ9Q7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":794647,"name":"Dreamscene Butterfly Blanket for Women Girls Fleece Travel Blanket Super Soft Warm Cozy Sofa Bed Throw Blanket 50\" X 60\" - Butterfly Baby Blanket, Pur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CMF-7Au5L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"ULTRA-SOFT AND COZY: Indulge in unrivaled comfort and warmth with our butterfly throw blanket. Expertly crafted from premium materials, this blanket offers a heavenly softness that invites you to cuddle up and unwind. Its plush texture provides a gentle caress against your skin, enveloping you in a world of cozy relaxation. Versatile and stylish, it effortlessly enhances any space, whether you're snuggling on the couch, adding a vibrant touch to your room, or seeking extra warmth on chilly nights. With our butterflies print throw blanket, you'll experience ultimate coziness while infusing your surroundings with a delightful burst of color. MODERN COLOR FOR PERFECT GIFT: Our fleece throw blanket makes the perfect butterfly gifts for women. Featuring a beautiful Purple/White color scheme with a captivating 3D butterfly animal print. The combination of colors and intricate butterfly design adds a touch of style and visual appeal to any living space, making it a perfect addition to your home decor. EASY TO CARRY SIZE: The fleece blanket measures a generous 50\" x 60\" (125 x 150cm), making it an ideal choice for various purposes. Whether you need a cozy cover for your small bed, a comfortable throw to snuggle up with on the couch, or a stylish accessory to drape over your settee or sofa, this blanket has got you covered. Its perfect dimensions provide ample coverage and warmth, allowing you to enjoy its softness, or take on your camping or travel. DURABLE, LONG LASTING MATERIAL: Our fleece throw blanket is made from 100% Polyester microfiber, ensuring a soft and cozy feel against your skin. The microfiber fabric is known for its durability and resistance to wrinkles, making it a reliable choice for long-lasting comfort. Additionally, the blanket is machine washable at a temperature of 104°F, allowing for easy care maintenance and convenient cleaning. CHARMING BUTTERFLY DESIGN: Our oversized blanket showcases a charming butterfly design that instantly adds a touch of allure to any space. Whether draped over your sofa, laid on your bed, or used as a cozy travel or camping blanket companion, this blanket's delightful butterfly pattern brings a captivating and stylish element to your decor. Stay warm and embrace the beauty of nature with our charming butterfly fleece throw.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CMF-7Au5L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreamscene","source_asin":"B0C5XVG3FD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5XVG3FD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5XVG3FD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
