window.products.push({"id":794932,"name":"Kuprum Copper Saucepan with Lid 2.5 Quarts Hand-Hammered Tin Lined","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512XJvWOHYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specialty copper saucepan handmade and hand-hammered. Made of solid copper and nonreactive tin linings; has excellent heat conductivity and melts sugar without clumping. Ideal for heating sauces, cooking beans, heating soups, steaming vegetables, caramelizing sugar, beating eggs or cream. Rounded bottom for easier whisking and elegant handle secured with rivets. Hand-hammered by skilled artisans from the Mediterranean (100% Recyclable - Limited Lifetime Warranty). Kuprum products are Artisanale, they are crafted with passion and great skill. They proudly carry the Mediterranean spirit to your kitchen with their quality, and to your table with their dazzling look. This product is 100% recyclable. By time, copper will naturally form a dark layer, which doesn't affect its performance. Occasionally use a non-abrasive cleaner to keep your copperware look new. Kuprum products are ideal for gas and electric cooktops, but not for inductions. Please use wood or plastic utensils to avoid scratching the tin lining. We recommend not to heat an empty pot above 450°F. Do not use in dishwasher or in microwave. Kuprum cookware aims to deliver rich flavor and texture when cooking a wide range of food. These copperware heats up rapidly and cools down quickly for maximum control and cooking results. Copperware also distributes heat more evenly than other popular materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512XJvWOHYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kuprum","source_asin":"B014GTCDGE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014GTCDGE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014GTCDGE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
