window.products.push({"id":794964,"name":"Hickory Manor House Vintage Blanc Buxton Swan for Home Decor, 17-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C-4HBSWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For over 30 years, Hickory Manor House/Craft-tex has produced unique home accessories. Swans have long occupied the pages of legendary stories and folklore. Now you can bring the elegance and timeless mystique of the swan into your garden with the Carolina Swan. Handcrafted from wood this authentic-looking decorative decoy features a vintage blanc finish that enhances its traditional antique style. This swan will make a delightful addition to your flower garden. The detailed process of crafting this swan and others like it in the American Waterfowl Collection involves detailed carving molding and finishing. First master carvers hand-carve the original American Waterfowl sculpture. Next molds are made from the originals and then hand-cast using a variety of mediums to ensure the exact detailing of the original woodcarving. Then American folk artists from North Carolina paint them by hand to specifications using acrylic paint and stain. The artist signs and dates each piece. Finally a protective coating is applied to ensure long-lasting resilience to the outdoor elements. The result of this detailed process is a realistic-looking swan decoy proudly made in the Craft-Tex/Ladybug Craft-Tex and Ladybug are special product lines produced by Concept Plastics Inc. Concept Plastics is Americas premier maker of fine furniture and decorative resin castings. Established in 1970 in High Point N.C. Concept Plastics uses extremely accurate molding techniques exceptional craftsmanship in casting and artisan skills in hand finishing. The Craft-Tex and Ladybug lines offer a wide variety of products for the home office and garden including birdbaths fountains statues planters bookends and decorative wall decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C-4HBSWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hickory Manor House","source_asin":"B00NWH5M5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NWH5M5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NWH5M5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
