window.products.push({"id":794972,"name":"Knife sharpener, 3 Stage Professional Kitchen Knife Sharpener, Manual Knife Sharpening Tool for Easily Quickly Restore, Renew, Polish Straight-Edge Kn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gYtiJiLUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our knife sharpener can keep your knife sharp at all times. Blunt knives are a potential hazard in the kitchen. The blade that is not sharp not only consumes a lot of energy when cutting ingredients, but also easily gets out of your control and scratches your hands. Using our knife sharpener can sharpen the blades simply and efficiently to bring your blades back to life. And also, it is lightweight and fits perfectly in drawer. Multiple features: -The ergonomic handle is easy to grip and control. -The non-slip base ensures an extra level of protection. -Number 2 slot: Sharpening the blades to restore the knife's V-shape. -Number 1 slot: Repairing and straightening the damaged blades. -Number 3 slot: Smoothing the blades' edge and polishing it. -Another 2 functions for scissors sharpening and sharp tools sharpening, such as fish hooks, needles etc. Product details: Name: Knife sharpener Material:ABS and Stainless steel Size: 8.45in X 2in X 2.5in Instructions: Step 1: place the knife sharpener on a flat surface. Step 2: hold the handle of the knife sharpener. Step 3: guide the blade of the knife at an angle of 90° into the desired sharpener slot. Step 4: pull the knife toward you 4 to 16 times until it is as sharp as the required sharpness. (One direction ONLY. Do not pull the knife backward and forward.)  Notes: Always wipe the knife sharpener up with a damp cloth or mild brush to make it dry after use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gYtiJiLUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ldab","source_asin":"B08CTXRH9H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-794972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CTXRH9H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CTXRH9H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
